[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3 uid="uid://unitmeshinstance3dskinnedribbon"]

; The one variable: the skinned deformation. A MeshInstance3D names a Skeleton3D through `skeleton`,
; and its RibbonTrailMesh, which writes bone indices and weights, bends along the posed bones: the
; third bone is turned 60 degrees about Z, so the lower half of the ribbon swings aside. No other
; scene binds a MeshInstance3D to a Skeleton3D in its own file, so no other golden shows a regression
; in it. unit-mesh-instance-3d-skinned-ribbon-instanced.tscn instances this scene.

